<section class="section section--paper" id="types" aria-labelledby="s2-title">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="shead">
      <div class="shead__meta"></div>
      <div class="shead__body">
        <h2 class="shead__title rv" id="s2-title">Types of Mobile App Security Testing Services We Provide</h2>
        <p class="shead__lede rv" style="--d:1">Our mobile app security testing services help businesses identify application vulnerabilities and protect sensitive information across Android and iOS platforms. We combine security assessments with practical testing methodologies to uncover weaknesses and recommend effective remediation measures.</p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="ledger">
      <article class="ledger__cell rv">
        <div class="ledger__head">{{ icon("mobile") }}</div>
        <h3 class="ledger__title">Android App Security Testing</h3>
        <p class="ledger__text">We test Android applications for insecure data storage and weak authentication along with excessive permissions and exposed application components. Our assessment identifies security gaps that could expose user information or compromise application functionality.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ledger__cell rv" style="--d:1">
        <div class="ledger__head">{{ icon("mobile-key") }}</div>
        <h3 class="ledger__title">iOS App Security Testing</h3>
        <p class="ledger__text">Our team evaluates iOS applications for weaknesses in data protection and authentication alongside insecure keychain usage and permission handling. We identify potential risks and recommend improvements to strengthen application security and protect sensitive data.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ledger__cell rv" style="--d:2">
        <div class="ledger__head">{{ icon("target") }}</div>
        <h3 class="ledger__title">Mobile App Penetration Testing</h3>
        <p class="ledger__text">We simulate authorized attacks against mobile applications to identify exploitable vulnerabilities and assess existing security controls. Our penetration testing helps businesses understand potential attack paths and prioritize remediation based on risk severity.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ledger__cell rv" style="--d:3">
        <div class="ledger__head">{{ icon("api") }}</div>
        <h3 class="ledger__title">Mobile API Security Testing</h3>
        <p class="ledger__text">We examine APIs connecting mobile applications with backend systems to uncover broken access controls and authentication flaws along with sensitive data exposure and insecure request handling. Our testing helps protect application endpoints and prevent unauthorized access to business information.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ledger__cell rv">
        <div class="ledger__head">{{ icon("radar") }}</div>
        <h3 class="ledger__title">Mobile App Vulnerability Assessment</h3>
        <p class="ledger__text">We conduct structured vulnerability assessments to identify and classify security weaknesses across mobile applications. Our findings highlight critical risks and provide actionable remediation recommendations that help development teams address vulnerabilities effectively.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ledger__cell rv" style="--d:1">
        <div class="ledger__head">{{ icon("lock") }}</div>
        <h3 class="ledger__title">Mobile Data Storage and Encryption Testing</h3>
        <p class="ledger__text">We assess how mobile applications store and transmit sensitive information while reviewing encryption practices and data protection controls. Our testing identifies insecure local storage and weak encryption along with communication vulnerabilities that could expose confidential data.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ledger__cell rv" style="--d:2">
        <div class="ledger__head">{{ icon("code") }}</div>
        <h3 class="ledger__title">Mobile App Source Code Security Review</h3>
        <p class="ledger__text">We analyze mobile application source code to detect insecure coding practices and potential security flaws. Our review focuses on authentication logic and input validation alongside data handling and other security-sensitive functions that could introduce application vulnerabilities.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ledger__cell rv" style="--d:3">
        <div class="ledger__head">{{ icon("badge") }}</div>
        <h3 class="ledger__title">OWASP Mobile Security Assessment</h3>
        <p class="ledger__text">We evaluate mobile application security controls against relevant OWASP Mobile Application Security Verification Standard (MASVS) requirements and testing guidance. Our assessment identifies gaps in security implementation and provides recommendations to improve alignment with recognized mobile security practices.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

