<section class="section section--stone" aria-labelledby="s4-title">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="shead">
      <div class="shead__meta"></div>
      <div class="shead__body">
        <h2 class="shead__title rv" id="s4-title">Common Vulnerabilities Our Mobile Application Security Testing Finds</h2>
        <p class="shead__lede rv" style="--d:1">Our mobile application security testing services help businesses uncover security weaknesses that could expose sensitive data or put mobile applications at risk. We assess common vulnerabilities across Android and iOS apps along with their APIs and data communication to help organizations strengthen application security.</p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="triggers">
      <div class="trigger rv">
        <span class="trigger__ico">{{ icon("unlock", "lg") }}</span>
        <h3 class="trigger__title">Weak Authentication and Access Controls</h3>
        <p class="trigger__text">We identify weaknesses in login processes and user permissions that could allow unauthorized users to access accounts or restricted application features.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="trigger rv">
        <span class="trigger__ico">{{ icon("database", "lg") }}</span>
        <h3 class="trigger__title">Insecure Data Storage</h3>
        <p class="trigger__text">Our testing detects sensitive information stored without adequate protection on mobile devices. This includes login credentials and personal details that could be exposed if a device is compromised.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="trigger rv">
        <span class="trigger__ico">{{ icon("wifi", "lg") }}</span>
        <h3 class="trigger__title">Insecure Network Communication</h3>
        <p class="trigger__text">We check how applications exchange information with servers to identify weak encryption and unsafe communication practices that could expose sensitive data during transmission.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="trigger rv">
        <span class="trigger__ico">{{ icon("api", "lg") }}</span>
        <h3 class="trigger__title">Mobile API Security Vulnerabilities</h3>
        <p class="trigger__text">Our mobile API security testing identifies access control gaps and authentication issues along with exposed data that could allow attackers to access information or misuse application features.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="trigger rv">
        <span class="trigger__ico">{{ icon("gear", "lg") }}</span>
        <h3 class="trigger__title">Insecure Code and Application Configuration</h3>
        <p class="trigger__text">We examine application code and security settings to identify coding errors and misconfigurations that could expose internal information or create opportunities for exploitation.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="trigger rv">
        <span class="trigger__ico">{{ icon("key", "lg") }}</span>
        <h3 class="trigger__title">Weak Encryption and Data Protection</h3>
        <p class="trigger__text">We assess the protection applied to sensitive information to identify weak encryption practices or improper handling of cryptographic keys that could compromise user privacy.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="trigger rv">
        <span class="trigger__ico">{{ icon("container", "lg") }}</span>
        <h3 class="trigger__title">Vulnerable Third-Party Libraries</h3>
        <p class="trigger__text">Our assessment checks third-party components for known security weaknesses that could introduce risks through outdated dependencies or insecure software packages.</p>
