<section class="section section--ink" aria-labelledby="s5-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="process">
      <div class="process__aside">
        <h2 class="process__title" id="s5-title">Our Mobile App Security Testing Process</h2>
        <p class="process__lede">We follow a structured mobile app security testing process to identify vulnerabilities and help businesses protect their applications against security threats. Our approach combines detailed security assessments with practical recommendations to strengthen Android and iOS applications.</p>
      </div>

      <ol class="process__list" data-process>
        <li class="step">
          <span class="step__marker" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <h3 class="step__title">Application Scope and Requirement Analysis</h3>
          <p class="step__text">We review your application's architecture and business requirements to define the testing scope. This includes identifying Android and iOS platforms along with APIs and critical application features that require assessment.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="step">
          <span class="step__marker" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <h3 class="step__title">Security Assessment and Vulnerability Identification</h3>
          <p class="step__text">Our team examines application settings and data handling practices alongside authentication and access controls to identify weaknesses through mobile application security testing.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="step">
          <span class="step__marker" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <h3 class="step__title">Mobile App Penetration Testing</h3>
          <p class="step__text">We perform authorized security tests to determine how identified weaknesses could be exploited. Our mobile app penetration testing services examine potential risks involving application access and sensitive data along with API communication.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="step">
          <span class="step__marker" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <h3 class="step__title">Risk Analysis and Prioritization</h3>
          <p class="step__text">Each finding is evaluated based on its severity and potential business impact. We classify vulnerabilities by priority so your development team can focus on the issues that pose the greatest security risks.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="step">
          <span class="step__marker" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <h3 class="step__title">Security Report and Remediation Guidance</h3>
          <p class="step__text">We provide a detailed security report covering identified vulnerabilities and their potential impact along with recommended fixes. The findings support informed decisions for improving mobile application security.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="step">
          <span class="step__marker" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <h3 class="step__title">Remediation Verification and Retesting</h3>
          <p class="step__text">After fixes are implemented, we retest the reported vulnerabilities to verify the effectiveness of the corrective measures. This helps confirm that addressed issues are resolved and that the application has improved its security posture.</p>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

